RAG architecture

The system needs grounded RAG, not generic RAG.

Example:

Officer:

"Have we seen this modus operandi before?"

Pipeline:

Current case
      ↓
Extract characteristics
      ↓
Semantic search
      +
Structured filters
      ↓
Similar historical cases
      ↓
Cross-check metadata
      ↓
Evidence ranking
      ↓
LLM explanation

The answer should look conceptually like:

Potential matches: 4

Case #1842
Similarity: 87%

Supporting factors:
• Same entry method
• Similar time window
• Same locality
• Similar vehicle description

Contradicting factors:
• Different weapon

Confidence: Medium

Source records:
[Case 1842]
[Case 1931]
...

That is much more useful than:

"Yes, there seems to be a connection."

